# MO-001: Assay residual acid after a requested esterification
# Design only: predictions below are not measured observations.
register lv3
add v1 CH3COOH 0.001mol
add v1 ethanol 0.001mol
react v1 esterification
inspect v1
add v1 water 100mL
titrate v1 NaOH 0.1M 0.1mL until ph 8.5 max 150
inspect v1
new
add v2 CH3COOH 0.001mol
add v2 ethanol 0.001mol
add v2 water 100mL
titrate v2 NaOH 0.1M 0.1mL until ph 8.5 max 150
inspect
